As we wait for the banner to be unfurled, we present

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.300
Ahmaud Rashad, go!

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:02.780
All right, thanks, Bob.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.690
There's much rest, not enough rest.

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:15.560
Michael Jordan is trying to win a championship,

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:18.040
rest does not enter into the equation.

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:20.380
He also told me that he has never felt better

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:23.420
in this particular time during a championship run.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:27.980
He said the key for him is to have as much fun as possible in this series,

